    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I Damasiko hakuweho ntihakiri umurwa, hazaba itongo n'ikirundo cy'isakamburiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imidugudu ya Aroweri ibaye imyirare, izaba urwuri rw'imikumbi n'inama zayo kandi nta wuzayikoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibihome bizashira muri Efurayimu n'ubwami buzashira i Damasiko, n'abazaba bacitse ku icumu b'i Siriya na bo bazashira. Bizaba nk'uko icyubahiro cy'Abisirayeli cyabaye.” Ni ko Uwiteka Nyiringabo avuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uwo munsi icyubahiro cya Yakobo kizagabanuka, n'umubyibuho we uzashira ananuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bizamera nk'umusaruzi utema amasaka yeze agasarura amahundo, ndetse bizamera nk'uhumba amasaka mu kibaya cy'Abarafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko hazasigaramo ibihumbwa nk'iby'umutini unyeganyejwe, imbuto ebyiri cyangwa eshatu zo mu bushorishori zikaragarika, hakaragarika enye cyangwa eshanu zo ku mashami y'impande z'umutini wera cyane.” Ni ko Uwiteka Imana ya Isirayeli ivuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi umuntu azatumbīra Umuremyi we, amaso ye azita ku Uwera wa Isirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ntazatumbira ibyotero byaremwe n'intoki ze, ntazita ku bukorikori bw'intoki ze cyangwa Ashera n'ibishushanyo by'izuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi imidugudu ye ikomeye izamera nk'ahantu ho mu bibira no mu mpinga z'imisozi, aho Abisirayeli bamenesheje abantu hazaba imyirare rwose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko wibagiwe Imana y'agakiza kawe kandi ntiwibutse igitare cy'imbaraga zawe, ni cyo gitumye utera ingemwe zo kwinezeza n'ingurukira z'inyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umunsi waziteraga washyizeho uruzitiro bukeye usanga zarabije, ariko ibisarurwa bizabura ku munsi w'umubabaro n'agahinda gasāze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee! Ee! Ee! Umva imidugararo y'amahanga menshi ahorera nk'inyanja, umva no gusuma kw'amahanga asuma nk'amazi menshi yo ku rusumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga azasuma nk'amazi menshi yo ku rusumo, ariko Imana izabahana, na bo bazahungira kure nk'ibishingwe byo ku misozi iyo bijyanwa n'inkubi y'umuyaga, kandi bazirukanwa nk'umukungugu utumurwa na serwakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore ibitera ubwoba nimugoroba ariko bwajya gucya bagasanga nta bihari: uwo ni wo mugabane w'abatunyaga kandi ni byo bihembo by'abatwambura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
